+The reviewer independently checked the selected source map and notices, protected
+recovery, actual case/source/overlay correspondence, immutable closed evidence,
+public source refs and main CI. All 37 admission controls and the canonical
+validator with 18 controls pass. An altered actual closed S02 artifact was
+rejected, and a destination collision remained blocked. Exact prior S01 runtime
+evidence supports before-state reuse; no unchanged full runtime campaign was
+rerun or claimed.
+
+Finding F01 is resolved in the final package. Twenty-five excluded private cases
+now have individual opaque dispositions: 21 preserve useful product/integration
+boundaries through required positive and negative replacement controls, while
+four superseded editorial/taxonomy assertions retire. The separate two-file
+privacy exception preserves exactly seven literal edits; its original addresses,
+private case identities and private histories remain protected.
+
+Actual assembly must take only exact public core ancestry into a fresh target,
+without local hardlinks, alternates or implicit tags. Protected all-ref backups
+are recovery material. Every later transformation needs explicit path and hash
+declarations. Full migrated acceptance, replacement guardrails, independent
+oracles, second assembly, candidate recovery and a distinct final review remain
+mandatory. No physical, release or production signing claim is made.
+
+See [the hash-bound report](review.json), [review artifact hashes](review-artifacts.json),
+and [preserved finding and resolution](finding-F01.json).
